hings anymore. Flying up into the sky or delving into the earth both sound boring. It's cold up there, and it's stuffy down there.","nextNodeIds":[745120216]},{"nodeId":745120216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30509,"speakerName":"Frejus","textMapHash":445508978,"text":"I share that sentiment.","nextNodeIds":[745120217]},{"nodeId":745120217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30534,"speakerName":"Chenee","textMapHash":2266255826,"text":"In that case, could you make something that we'd use normally? ...Ooh, that's right! I love sleeping in in the mornings, so could you make me an automatic oven that bakes on its own?","nextNodeIds":[745120218]},{"nodeId":745120218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1120376922,"text":"Well now, that sounds possible.","nextNodeIds":[745120219]},{"nodeId":745120219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":590287634,"text":"Her earlier suggestions were intentionally impossible, I think.","nextNodeIds":[745120220]},{"nodeId":745120220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30509,"speakerName":"Frejus","textMapHash":2693555042,"text":"Alright, let me consider how this might be designed.","nextNodeIds":[745120221]},{"nodeId":745120221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30534,"speakerName":"Chenee","textMapHash":2878828066,"text":"Nice! I'll take that as agreement — and if it does prove impossible, you'll just have to make me breakfast in the future, eh, Frejus?","nextNodeIds":[745120222]},{"nodeId":745120222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30509,"speakerName":"Frejus","textMapHash":1922908674,"text":"What? What sort of request is that... In any case, you needn't worry, I'm sure such a small invention is well within my skill. I am, after all, a \"genius.\"","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7451201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHL